# The site's scripts and Markdown are LF; a contributor whose git has core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# commit CRLF through them. Only the listed types are touched — nothing is renormalized wholesale, and
# images stay untouched because they are detected as binary.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
